    "name": "Trauma and Adversity Exposure - General",
    "code": "PX630101",
    "abbreviation": "PX630101",
    "description": "The Life Events Checklist (LEC-5) for The Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders, Fifth Edition (DSM-5) is a self-report measure designed to screen for potentially traumatic events in a respondent’s lifetime. The sum of endorsements can be used as a variable for analysis, but the LEC-",
